{"id":19871,"author":"Silentdawnslight","body":"Heya, I've been curious about the teams and all here for a bit but have been reluctant about it because I'm pretty inexperienced. But you have to learn somehow, right? xD\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI'm pretty aggressive. I can ninja bridge straight, but that's about it there. Not the best at pvp but I keep my kills over my deaths. I'm best at just holding off and killing people, I'd say.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAnd I have both TS and Skype if needed~","body_tagged":"Heya, I've been curious about the teams and all here for a bit but have been reluctant about it because I'm pretty inexperienced. But you have to learn somehow, right? xD\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI'm pretty aggressive. I can ninja bridge straight, but that's about it there. Not the best at pvp but I keep my kills over my deaths. I'm best at just holding off and killing people, I'd say.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAnd I have both TS and Skype if needed~","created_at":1453624931,"title":"[LFT] Silentdawnslight","replies":[{"id":273461,"author":"DaFrozenBlaze","body":"VOUCH","body_tagged":"VOUCH","created_at":1453626378},{"id":273474,"author":"34th","body":"Apply for some teams, if you want to get into the bigger teams they don't look here. (Don't quote me), I would just apply for a team once at a time.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eGood Luck!","body_tagged":"Apply for some teams, if you want to get into the bigger teams they don't look here. (Don't quote me), I would just apply for a team once at a time.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eGood Luck!","created_at":1453630841},{"id":273476,"author":"Silentdawnslight","body":"How would one go about doing that? I've no idea. xD","body_tagged":"How would one go about doing that? I've no idea. xD","created_at":1453633047,"reply_to":273474},{"id":273490,"author":"34th","body":"Well you want to go to Looking For Members then click on a discussion (for example Cronus application) fill out the teams application process and wait for a response. (Just post a reply with the application questions and answers)","body_tagged":"Well you want to go to Looking For Members then click on a discussion (for example Cronus application) fill out the teams application process and wait for a response. (Just post a reply with the application questions and answers)","created_at":1453635453,"reply_to":273476},{"id":273505,"author":"Wahiz","body":"Interested. Contact me on skype if you wish to join. (danfromyoutube)","body_tagged":"Interested. Contact me on skype if you wish to join. (danfromyoutube)","created_at":1453639119},{"id":273625,"author":"Coco_stag","body":"Interested! Add me on skype (rirlomilothe9123)","body_tagged":"Interested! Add me on skype (rirlomilothe9123)","created_at":1453663614},{"id":273683,"author":"ApolloIsFunky","body":"Interested! Skype: google_processing","body_tagged":"Interested! Skype: google_processing","created_at":1453670843},{"id":273743,"author":"Coco_stag","body":"\u003cdiv class=\"row-fluid\" style=\"width: 869.984px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"span1\" style=\"float: left; min-height: 1px; margin-left: 0px; width: 52.0469px; box-sizing: border-box; padding-top: 3px; margin-right: 5px;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/Mr_Solstice\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none;\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\"round-mini\" src=\"https://crafatar.com/avatars/e0429b4918464f298e40ee5762d90a46?helm\u0026amp;size=45\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: auto; height: auto; vertical-align: middle; border: 0px; border-radius: 3px; margin: 0px 1px;\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"span11 no-margin\" style=\"float: left; min-height: 1px; margin-left: 0px; width: 795.625px; box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; margin-bottom: 0px !important;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/Mr_Solstice\" style=\"color: